+# Codebase Map — Core Files, Symbols, and Workflows
+
+**Status:** generated 2026-10-29 by Claude Code under task `DOC-013`.
+**Scope:** the executable core of the thesis experiment (runtime package +
+experiment CLI) in full, the Phase 4 analysis pipeline in outline, and the
+supporting data-generation tooling in brief.
+**Basis:** every claim below was read directly from the files in this
+repository at commit `4983840` (base of branch `task/DOC-013`). Line numbers
+are those of that commit and will drift as files change — treat them as
