+**Companion docs:** `docs/context/complete-context.md` (project overview),
+`docs/context/strategy-interface.md` (normative strategy contract),
+`docs/context/data-formats.md` (dataset formats), `docs/decisions/decision-log.md`
+(decision IDs cited throughout).
+
+**Reading convention.** Pseudocode in this document is deliberately
+language-neutral:
+
+- `←` assignment, `==` equality, `!=` inequality.
+- `for x in X:` / `if cond:` / `return` / `raise` are structural.
+- `A.f()` means a method call; `[ ... ]` denotes an ordered list.
+- Timing and metrics names are written exactly as in the code.
