+## 1. The one-paragraph architecture
+
+A **strategy** narrows a new concept against an existing `ConceptGraph` to a
+shortlist. A **shared decision step** asks an LLM, once per shortlisted
+candidate, whether one concept is a prerequisite of the other. The **shared
+insertion driver** validates the shortlist and the LLM's edges, mutates the
+graph, then tells the strategy to update its index. A **harness** repeats this
+for leave-one-out accuracy trials (DSA, Metacademy) or synthetic cost-sweep
+trials (six graph sizes), streaming one JSON record per trial. A separate
+**validation gate + analysis pipeline** recomputes metrics from raw records
+and emits every thesis table and figure.
+
+```
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+                         │      ConceptGraph        │  NetworkX DiGraph
+                         │  nodes: bare names       │  edge: prereq -> dependent
+                         │  domain_context: str|None│
+                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
+                                      │ read-only
+             setup(graph, embedder)   │
+                                      ▼
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+ new_name ──────────────>│   NarrowingStrategy      │  no LLM calls
+                         │   .shortlist(new_name)   │  may embed
+                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
+                                      │ Shortlist(candidates, scores)
+                                      ▼
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+                         │  DecisionStep            │  1 LLM call / candidate
+                         │  .decide(new, candidates)│  returns canonical edges
+                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
+                                      │ DecisionOutcome(edges, calls, seconds)
+                                      ▼
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+                         │  insert_node() driver    │
+                         │  validate -> mutate      │
+                         │  graph -> strategy.update│
+                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
+                                      │ InsertionResult + InsertionMetrics
+                                      ▼
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+                         │  Harness runners         │
+                         │  accuracy / sweep        │
+                         │  raw.jsonl + summary.csv │
+                         └────────────┬─────────────┘
+                                      ▼
+                         ┌──────────────────────────┐
+                         │ validate_runs.py gate    │ fail-closed
+                         │ run_analysis.py          │ tables + figures
+                         └──────────────────────────┘
+```
+
