+### 4.5 `src/graph_insertion/embedding.py`
+
+**Purpose:** the `Embedder` protocol, a metering decorator, and a deterministic
+offline embedder.
+
+**Symbol map**
+
+| Symbol | Line | Kind | Contract |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| `Embedder` | 21 | Protocol | `embed(str) -> 1-D ndarray`, `embed_many(seq) -> 2-D ndarray` |
+| `MeteredEmbedder` | 34 | class | counts calls/texts/seconds; optional text log |
+| `.embed` | 62 | method | timed single embed |
+| `.embed_many` | 73 | method | timed batch embed |
+| `.reset` | 84 | method | zero all meters |
+| `FakeEmbedder` | 93 | class | hash-seeded deterministic unit vectors |
+| `._embed_single` | 111 | method | SHA-256-derived RNG -> L2-normalised float32 |
+| `.embed` | 122 | method | single vector |
+| `.embed_many` | 125 | method | stacked matrix, shape `(0, dim)` for empty input |
+
+**Pseudocode**
+
+```
+MeteredEmbedder.embed(text):
+    t0 <- now(); result <- underlying.embed(text); elapsed <- now() - t0
+    calls += 1; texts_embedded += 1; cumulative_seconds += elapsed
+    if texts_log is not None: append(text)
+    return result
+
+MeteredEmbedder.embed_many(texts):
+    t0 <- now(); result <- underlying.embed_many(texts); elapsed <- now() - t0
+    calls += 1; texts_embedded += len(texts); cumulative_seconds += elapsed
+    if texts_log is not None: extend(texts)
+    return result
+
+MeteredEmbedder.reset():
+    calls <- 0; texts_embedded <- 0; cumulative_seconds <- 0.0
+    if texts_log is not None: clear
+
+FakeEmbedder._embed_single(text):
+    digest <- sha256(f"{seed}:{text}")[:8]
+    rng <- default_rng(int(digest, little-endian))
+    v <- rng.standard_normal(dim); v <- v / ||v|| if ||v|| > 0
+    return float32(v)
+
+FakeEmbedder.embed(text): return _embed_single(text)
+
+FakeEmbedder.embed_many(texts):
+    if empty: return empty((0, dim), float32)
+    return vstack([_embed_single(t) for t in texts])
+```
+
+**Note.** `MeteredEmbedder.calls` increments once per `embed`/`embed_many`
+call, not per text. `texts_embedded` is the per-string count. The single
+embedding invariant is checked with `calls` delta, not `texts_embedded`.
+
