+```
+setup(graph, embedder): self._graph <- graph; self._embedder <- None
+
+shortlist(new_name):
+    existing <- [n for n in sorted(graph.nodes()) if n != new_name]
+    if empty: return Shortlist((), ())
+    rng <- Random(seed)                     # re-seeded every call
+    selected <- rng.sample(existing, min(k, len(existing)))
+    return Shortlist(tuple(selected), tuple(0.0 for each))
+```
+
+**Determinism.** Re-seeding per call means the result depends only on
+`(seed, graph contents, new_name)`, not on call history. Sorting makes it
+independent of `PYTHONHASHSEED`.
