+**Pseudocode: `validate_single_run` (condensed)**
+
+```
+validate_single_run(run_dir, expected_hashes=None):
+    errors <- []
+    require manifest.json, strategy_config.json, raw.jsonl, summary.csv exist
+    manifest <- parse; sidecar <- parse; records <- parse_raw_jsonl
+    require manifest fields present and typed
+    require git_dirty is False
+    require sidecar strategy/config canonical; derive expected run id and
+        compare with directory/manifest
+    require trial key counts match PLANNED_TRIAL_COUNTS mode
+    require no corrupt duplicate key (a later key with earlier success)
+    recompute <- recompute_metrics(records, mode)
+    summary <- parse_summary_csv
+    for each recomputed aggregate:
+        compare to summary cell within tolerance; fail closed
+    require embedding-strategy thread pins and model identity
+    require brute-force absence of embedder/thread pin
+    if expected_hashes: verify four artifact hashes
+    build T3 inventory row (hashes, counts, status)
+    return (no errors, errors, info)
+
+validate_all_runs(results_dir, src_diff_clean=False, hashes_path=None):
+    discover run dirs (single dir or child dirs with manifest)
+    validate each; collect errors
+    require git commit uniform within mode
+    if commits differ across modes and not src_diff_clean: fail
+    require library block identical across all runs
+    build T3 CSV string
+    return (overall_passed, results, t3_csv)
+```
