+```
+bootstrap_ci(data, statistic_fn=mean, n_resamples=10000, ci_level=0.95, seed=42):
+    drop None/NaN
+    if empty: (NaN, NaN)
+    if one value: (value, value)
+    rng <- default_rng(seed)
+    resample index matrix; compute statistic per resample
+    return percentiles at alpha/2 and 1-alpha/2
+```
