+
+**Pseudocode: `run_posthoc_stage`**
+
+```
+run_posthoc_stage(results_dir, accuracy_run_dirs, t1_rows, t2_rows,
+                  output_dir, crosscheck_dir):
+    inputs <- extract_inputs(t1_rows, t2_rows)
+    n_checks <- assert_matches_final_output(inputs, crosscheck_dir)
+    shortlist_means <- realised_shortlist_sizes(accuracy_run_dirs)
+    sm_baseline <- size_matched_baselines(inputs, shortlist_means)
+    mkdir tables, figures
+    gates <- compute_gates(inputs)
+    write T5, T5b
+    write T6
+    t7_rows, store <- build_t7_rows(inputs); write T7
+    t8_rows, mc_store, exact_store <- build_t8_rows(store)
+        write T8 (full precision CSV, 2-decimal MD), T8b (exact)
+    write T9, T9b
+    plot F7, F8, F9
+    return summary dict
+```
+
+**Pseudocode: `compute_A_C`**
+
+```
+compute_A_C(inputs, corpus):
+    f1 <- mean F1 per strategy
+    calls <- mean calls per strategy
+    g <- log10(1 + calls)
+    A <- min-max normalise(f1, higher better)
+    C <- min-max normalise(g, higher better=False)
+    degenerate flags if all values equal (all scores 0.5)
+    return {A, C, g, calls, f1,
+            degenerate: {"A": a_degenerate, "C": c_degenerate}}
+```
+
